n on invested capital", "RETURN_ON_TANGIBLE_ASSETS": "Return on tangible assets"}}, "dossier_fields": {"thesis_pillars": [{"citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/extract.json", "locator": 1, "passage": "transitions to advanced modalities like cell therapies and immune engagers.  \n \nINVESTMENT THESIS: \nSize + Growth: ANZ is not just a dividend vehicle like many big pharmas. Rev grew 8% \nin FY2025, with core EPS up", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}, "pillar": "Size + Growth", "terms": ["Size + Growth", "dividend"], "text": "ANZ is not just a dividend vehicle like many big pharmas. Rev grew 8% in FY2025, with core EPS up 11%."}, {"citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/extract.json", "locator": 1, "passage": " not just a dividend vehicle like many big pharmas. Rev grew 8% \nin FY2025, with core EPS up 11%.  \nExecution record: CEO Pascal Soriot set a $45 billion rev target a decade ago and hit it. \nHe then set the $80 bn ta", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}, "pillar": "Execution record", "terms": ["Execution record"], "text": "CEO Pascal Soriot set a $45 billion rev target a decade ago and hit it. He then set the $80 bn target. The management team has delivered 16 positive Phase III readouts in the past year alone. Track records of pipeline execution are rare and worth paying for. The $80 bn by 2030 target assumes significant growth in the existing oncology, biopharmaceuticals, and rare disease portfolio, and by launching an expected 20 new medicines before the end of the decade."}, {"citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/extract.json", "locator": 1, "passage": "e disease portfolio, and by launching an \nexpected 20 new medicines before the end of the decade.  \nStrong pipeline: Broad portfolio of over 100 ongoing Phase III trials and over 20 late-\nstage readouts slated for 2", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}, "pillar": "Strong pipeline", "terms": ["Strong pipeline"], "text": "Broad portfolio of over 100 ongoing Phase III trials and over 20 late- stage readouts slated for 2026. CEO called this an \"unprecedented catalyst-rich period.\u201d Mgmt has noted they've already achieved 10 of the 20 new medicines targeted as part of the 2030 roadmap."}, {"citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/extract.json", "locator": 1, "passage": "s noted they've already achieved 10 of the 20 new medicines targeted \nas part of the 2030 roadmap. \nEM growth driver: EM ex-China grew 22% in 2025. As healthcare systems in Asia, \nLatin America, and the Middle East d", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}, "pillar": "EM growth driver", "terms": ["EM growth driver"], "text": "EM ex-China grew 22% in 2025. As healthcare systems in Asia, Latin America, and the Middle East develop, AZN is well-positioned with an established commercial footprint in these regions. This could be a decades long tailwind"}, {"citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/extract.json", "locator": 1, "passage": " with an established \ncommercial footprint in these regions. This could be a decades long tailwind \nRare disease is high-margin: 2021 Alexion acq gave AZN a leading position in \ncomplement biology (treating ultra-rare diseases)", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}, "pillar": "Rare disease is high-margin", "terms": ["Rare disease is high-margin"], "text": "2021 Alexion acq gave AZN a leading position in complement biology (treating ultra-rare diseases). These drugs face almost no generic competition, have high prices, & have loyal patient populations. Rare Disease grew 15% in Q1 2026."}], "management": {"status": "SERVED", "value": "MANAGEMENT:", "citation": {"locator": 2, "passage": "MANAGEMENT:", "report_id": "0a5233696e05484c", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/0a5233696e05484c/ASTRAZENECA Research Pack 2026 06 17_v1.pdf"}}, "fund_of_record": {"status": "SERVED", "value": "IDVZ", "citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/ffa70690f2345fdb/extract.json", "locator": 2, "passage": "RECOMMENDATION: MAINTAIN 1.75% POSITION IN IDVZ", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/ffa70690f2345fdb/AZN Q2 2026 Earnings Update.docx"}}, "last_stated_position": {"status": "SERVED", "value": {"fund": "IDVZ", "size_pct": "1.75", "text": "MAINTAIN 1.75% POSITION IN IDVZ"}, "citation": {"extract_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report-extract/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/ffa70690f2345fdb/extract.json", "locator": 2, "passage": "RECOMMENDATION: MAINTAIN 1.75% POSITION IN IDVZ", "report_key": "s3://opal-data-harvest/amgt/harvest/bronze/research-report/security_key=AZN_LN_Equity/ffa70690f2345fdb/AZN Q2 2026 Earnings Update.docx"}}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-30T11:36Z", "drafted_sections": [], "dr